  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……智代子は、何か『遠慮』をしているんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──え",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bg": "00130",
    "bgm": "017",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いや、急だったな\r\nごめん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……今日の撮影を見ていたら\r\n少し気になってしまって──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そっ、それはっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "今日のお仕事の出来がよくなかったとか、\r\nそういう──！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あっ、違う違うっ、そうじゃないんだ！\r\n紛らわしい言い方になって悪い……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事自体はなんの問題もないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "カメラマンさんだって褒めてくれてた\r\n智代子も聞いてただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "は、はい……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "よかった……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうじゃなくて──……\r\nえーと、俺の感じ方で申し訳ないんだが",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事中の智代子は、まだどこか\r\nセーブがかかっているように見えるというか──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、力を抜いてるわけじゃないっていうのは\r\nわかってる。そこを疑ってるんじゃなくてな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ただ、智代子が意識していないところに、\r\n何かがあるんじゃないかと思って──……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "それが、『遠慮』……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\n……イメージの話をするぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "智代子はいつも、もう一歩前に出られそうなところで、\r\nその一歩を踏み出さずにいる感じがするんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "園田智代子というアイドルを100％出してもいいのか\r\n迷っているように見えるというか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010120"
  },
  {
    "select": "……少し\r\n考えてみてほしい",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "──悪い、\r\n考えすぎないでくれ！",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "……俺は──",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今すぐ答えを出すとかじゃなくていいからさ\r\n俺の意見に対してどう思った、とかでもいいし",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうだろう？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "はい……──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……今まで、そういう自覚はなかったので──\r\nすごく、驚きました。けど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……もしかしたら、っていうのもあって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "……すみません、プロデューサーさん\r\nやっぱりもう少し、時間をください",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010170"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺もハッキリ説明できないのに\r\n混乱させるようなこと言って──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そんな！\r\nとんでもないです、全然です……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010190,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "これって、ちゃんと考えなきゃいけないことだと思うんです\r\n私にとって、すごく大事なことで……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201000701/2010007010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010007010200,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "でも、自分じゃ絶対気付けなかった\r\n……大事なことなのに……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
